What it is for: stop keeping server addresses, users, ports and keys in
your head, notes or shell history

Why it helps: `sshr connect web` replaces a long ssh line, the same list
feeds the app, the CLI, sync, MCP and the API

Why this way: plain files on your machine work offline, survive any
crash of sshr and can be backed up or read without it, one file per host
keeps a broken file from taking the others with it
